EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I just got an idea, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Let's go to my house today!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}I'll give you an exclusive showing of
the place where all the training
magic happens!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Let's go!
No thanks.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hab 'ne Idee, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Lass uns in meine Bude gehen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Dann kann ich dir endlich zeigen,
wie ich trainiere, um so athletisch
zu sein, dass alle neidisch werden!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Bin dabei!
Nein danke.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aklıma bir fikir geldi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bugün benim eve gidelim!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Antrenman büyüsünün
gerçekleştiği yeri sana özel olarak gezdireceğim!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Hadi gidelim!
Yok, sağ ol.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Oye!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hoy deberías venir a mi casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Puedo enseñarte el palacio en el
que me pongo en forma. {{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Ja, ja!
Estoy seguro de que no te aburrirás.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Qué me dices?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Te apetecería?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Por supuesto!
Hoy no

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bugün benim eve uğrasana.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Sana eski
antrenman sarayını gezdiririm, {{TAG:0003:0023:}}heh heh!
Sıkıcı olmayacağına neredeyse eminim.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ee ne dersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Var mısın?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Kesinlikle!
Bugün olmaz.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün sana evimi göstereceğim. Eski
antrenman sarayını.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Bu destansı fiziğe nasıl ulaştığımı
bilmek istiyorsun,
değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Heh heh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Meşhur {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}}
Köşkü'nü gez ve öğren!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Ben varım!
Ben yokum!

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Rekabetçi sporlar insanı gaza getirir;
çünkü yalnızca
kendine ya da saate karşı
yarışmazsın.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Yanlış anlama!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ev dekorasyonu da rekabettir!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}} Ama rakibin olarak,
evimin içini sana göstereceğim!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ee ne dersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} Düşman antrenman kampına göz
atmak ister misin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Tamam, gidelim!
Yok, sağ ol!

EN:
Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Come over to my house!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You know, just a crazy idea off the
top of my head!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} No big deal!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}What do you think?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Want to see my 
legendary training palace?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Can't keep me away!
Let's rain-check it.

FR:
Yo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ça te dirait de passer chez moi, là,
tout de suite ?
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}L'idée m'a traversé la tête à
l'instant, rien de plus, hein !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Alors, qu'est-ce que tu en dis ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Envie de voir à quoi ressemble la
maison d'un surhomme ?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Oh oui !
Plus tard, merci.

DE:
Hey ho, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Komm doch rüber in meine Bude!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}War nur so 'ne Idee!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nichts weiter!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wie sieht's aus?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Traust du dich ins
legendäre „Dojo von {{TAG:0005:0001:}}“?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Klar doch!
Ich weiß nicht recht...

TRANSLATION:
Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Benim eve gelsene!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Aklıma pat diye gelen
çılgın bir fikir işte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Önemli bir şey değil!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ne dersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Efsanevi
antrenman sarayımı
görmek ister misin?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Beni kimse tutamaz!
Başka zamana.
